  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Write the failing tests first (blocking SprkModal, no `nonBlocking`): run them on unchanged code and record that they fail.</step>
    <step order="2">Implement the preferred fix (or the fallback, with the reason).</step>
    <step order="3">Update the `yieldToSidePane` prop doc.</step>
    <step order="4">Filtered jest for SprkModal (all its __tests__ and presets/__tests__), FilePreview, DocumentEmailWizard, FindSimilarViewer, AccessGrantModal; typecheck; client-lint ratchet.</step>
