  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Test: a blocking SprkModal (no `nonBlocking`) with `yieldToSidePane` and the layering stub ending in 'dock' (pane layer with no z-index): no element of the modal at the pane's position takes pointer events (no backdrop present, or its computed pointer-events is none). This test FAILS on origin/master code.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Test: same with layering 'under' (pane layer z 1000) and while 'pending' (before the pane appears).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Test: when `yieldToSidePane` returns to false, the blocking modal has its backdrop back and it takes pointer events; the body is not remounted (mount counter unchanged, child state kept) and the surface is the same DOM node.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Test: a non-yielding blocking modal and a non-yielding nonBlocking modal render as before (backdrop present / absent respectively).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: `hidden` behaviour unchanged (existing tests pass unmodified).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">All existing SprkModal / preset / a11y / FilePreview / DocumentEmailWizard tests pass unmodified; typecheck clean; client-lint ratchet passes; SemanticSearchControl version bumped (manifest + solution) and build:prod succeeds.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>
  <escalation>
